⚡️ Meet Tron 2, a robot from China-based LimX Dynamics that can change its body for different jobs.

It can use a fixed base for precise tasks, a wheeled-leg base to carry heavy loads, or two legs to walk and climb stairs. The arms and brain stay the same, while the lower body changes depending on the mission.

